      <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p><em>Last Updated: August 28, 2026</em></p>

      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>TheWhiteScreen.org</strong>. By accessing or using our website, tools, and services, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following Terms & Conditions.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Use of Service</h2>
      <p>
        TheWhiteScreen.org provides a free, web-based tool for monitor cleaning, dead pixel testing, webcam lighting, and background image downloads. You are permitted to use this service for personal, educational, or commercial purposes free of charge.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Intellectual Property & Image Usage</h2>
      <p>
        All static blank color wallpapers generated using our client-side canvas tool are free to download and use for personal or commercial desktop/mobile wallpapers.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The tools and services on TheWhiteScreen.org are provided "AS IS" without warranty of any kind. While our tools assist in identifying dead or stuck pixels, we do not guarantee repair of hardware defects.
